WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open the PeopleOps Intelligence Agent and choose an HR policy Q&A task. The recording uses a read-only demo environment.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Ask a travel reimbursement question. The answer shows reviewable policy sources, cited excerpts and page references.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Request a candidate interview. The tool returns approval mode, and email, calendar and ATS execution remain blocked.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:58.000
After submitting the action, the task waits for approval. No external action runs before explicit HRBP approval.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:14.000
The task record keeps the original input, current state, run time and audit-chain validation result.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:30.000
System settings show approval-tool mode, hashed audit chain and local demo boundaries.
